# Third-party / generated code: keep GitHub language statistics meaningful.
#
# 1. libs/SDL2 is vendored SDL2 source (C, C++, Objective-C, M4, Perl, Shell,
#    CMake, Makefile, Assembly, Metal). Without this it dominated the
#    repository language breakdown (C ~87%).
libs/** linguist-vendored

# 2. android/app/.cxx is CMake build output committed to the repo
#    (generated headers, ninja logs, JSON). It is not project source.
android/app/.cxx/** linguist-generated
